    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21787" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">immūtesco</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inm-</span></b> ), tŭi, 3, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch. n.</i>
			[in-mutesco], <i>to become dumb</i> or <i>speechless</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">immutescamus alioqui, si nihil dicendum
					videatur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 10, 3, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ruptis ore querelis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 5, 542</span></i>
			.</div>
